        <p class="text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-8 italic">
          The polymeric sand aisle at a big-box store is genuinely small — usually two brands, two colours each — and that limited choice is fine for most patios. The decision that actually matters is not which bag, but whether your joints are inside the width range printed on it.
        </p>

